Subject: [PATCH] compose: compositor unit tests

The tests check the compositor's contract using option tables written in
the test file, so shipped data changes do not break them. They cover
golden seed-derivation vectors, the weighted pick's range math and
distribution, per-label independence, host capacity limits, GPU cluster
selection, array merging and option-set matching. A failure in the
golden vectors means every existing seed produces a different device.

